<title>AUSTRALIA: TENNIS-AUSTRALIAN OPEN SCHEDULE FOR FRIDAY.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-AUSTRALIAN OPEN SCHEDULE FOR FRIDAY.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schedule of Friday's matches at the Australian Open:</p>
<p>Centre court</p>
<p>Men's singles semifinal: 1-Pete Sampras (U.S.) v 5-Thomas Muster (Austria)</p>
<p>Women's doubles final 4-Martina Hingis (Switzerland)/Natasha Zvereva (Belarus) v 3-Lindsay Davenport/Lisa Raymond (U.S.)</p>
